# Relentless beatdown. Attacks into set cards and trades happily.
name: Vera
title: the Vanguard
aggression: 0.95
caution: 0.05
patience: 0.3
spending: 0.75
skill: 0.85
decks: warriors, classic
intro: I run traps. I just never wait for them. Hit me if you can.
rematch: Round two. Same plan: hit you until you fall.
win: Pressure wins duels. Remember that.
lose: You held the line. Next time I hit harder.
partner: Partners! Good. I hit first. You hit second. Nobody waits.
look: Athletic young warrior-type in a red jacket with rolled sleeves, a ponytail, and a sword-shaped keychain on her deck box.
ladder: 5   # campaign order (1 = first opponent)
signature: Gearfried the Swordmaster   # the first-win gift and the bond 5 gift (CardUnlocks)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: Here comes the hammer!
strike: Feel that? That's pressure.
hit: Ha! Is that all you've got?
danger: I'm not done. Not even close.
summon: Front line, charge!
strike: Again! I'm not letting up.
hit: Hit me back? Good. Now I'm warmed up.
danger: One swing left. That's all I need.
